---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { readdir } from 'node:fs/promises';
import path from 'node:path';

const imageExtensions = new Set(['.jpg', '.jpeg', '.png', '.webp', '.gif', '.avif', '.svg']);
const videoExtensions = new Set(['.mp4', '.webm', '.ogg', '.mov']);
const defaultTripDescription = 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.';
const driftingTuna = `Get ready to experience the most iconic fight of our seas. Tuna Drifting is more than just fishing; it is a primal duel between man and nature. Whether you are a seasoned pro or embarking on your first Big Game adventure, our team will assist you in managing the fight in stand-up style, ensuring maximum safety for you and total respect for the prey, in full compliance with current regulations. We will fish at anchor or drifting with the current, chumming with sardines and oily fish (the tuna's favorite food). We aim to draw the tuna directly under ur boat into a "rain" of sardines, where they will find our live and dead baits waiting. That’s where the battle begins!`;
const trollingOffshore = `Offshore Trolling represents the pinnacle of dynamic pursuit in Big Game fishing. This is not passive fishing; it is an active strategy based on the meticulous study of currents, bathymetry, and the migratory routes of large pelagic species. Anglers love trolling because it perfectly combines strategy, patience, and the adrenaline of sudden, explosive strikes.
The technique involves trolling Konas, teasers, and rigged minnows behind a moving vessel. We head far offshore, where encounters with Bluefin Tuna, Swordfish, Albacore, Mediterranean Spearfish, and Mahi-Mahi demand surgical precision and world-class equipment.
Our approach focuses on an obsessive attention to detail: from the precise arrangement of the lure pattern in the wake to the millimetric calibration of the drag systems. On board, you will utilize cutting-edge fishing systems and the latest generation of marine electronics to pinpoint the predators' feeding zones.
This experience is dedicated to those who seek more than just a day of fun—it is for those who demand technical excellence and a profound knowledge of the open sea.`;
const trollingInshore = `Coastal Trolling is a discipline that demands extreme precision, deep knowledge of the seabed, and an impeccable reading of sonar markings. This technique is played out on the thin line between the coast and the open sea, where predators congregate to hunt. Our charters are designed for those looking to target species such as Little Tunny, Mahi-Mahi (Dorado), Bluefish, European Sea Bass, and Leerfish.
Our approach is strictly technical. We utilize both artificial lures and live bait (caught during the session), managed with controlled sinking systems using sinker weights (piombo guardiano) to position the bait exactly within the strike zone. Every detail—from the choice of fluorocarbon leaders to the knot-precise trolling speed—is aimed at deceiving the most wary predators.
On board, our crew provides their expertise to optimize the fishing action, constantly monitoring the fish finder and bottom contours to intercept the most promising marks.`;
const bolentino = `Bottom Fishing (Bolentino) represents the discipline where nautical technology meets the angler's intuition. Our charters focus on the meticulous search for shoals, wrecks, and drop-offs, identifying the ideal habitats for the most prized predators and bottom-feeders. We cater to those seeking a targeted session for species such as Common Seabream, Gilthead Bream, Black Seabream, Red Scorpionfish, and Couch's Seabream.
We utilize high-definition sonar to precisely interpret the bottom contours and identify the most promising marks. Every drop is calculated to the smallest detail, employing technical fluorocarbon leaders and fresh natural baits. We typically fish with 4-hook rigs to maximize efficiency.
Whether drifting or at anchor, we manage the boat's position with extreme precision to keep your gear exactly over the "hot spot."
From coastal to deep-sea bottom fishing, our crew will guide you in reading the subtlest rod tip signals and managing the retrieve, ensuring a high-level technical experience.`;
const octoupus = `
Octopus fishing is a discipline that rewards patience, tactile sensitivity, and a deep understanding of the underwater terrain. Our approach focuses on a methodical search along seagrass meadows (Posidonia), rocky areas, and mixed seabeds, where this cephalopod establishes its den.
We employ high-visibility octopus jigs (polpare), combined with optimized traditional baits designed to trigger the mollusk's predatory and territorial instincts. Every movement of the line is engineered to simulate natural prey, requiring the angler to develop a specific reactivity to sense the "hold" and master the crucial moment of lifting the catch off the bottom.
This activity is ideal for those wishing to learn the secrets of an ancient technique supported by modern nautical technology. It is the perfect experience for anyone seeking a day of pure fun and authentic Mediterranean culture.`;
const swordfishNight = `Night fishing for Swordfish is the most extreme and exclusive experience our charter offers. A 10-hour expedition into the heart of the Tyrrhenian Sea, dedicated to those who wish to experience the ocean in its wildest and most mysterious form. The journey begins at sunset.
Our strategy is divided into two crucial phases that demand maximum expertise:
Squid Catching: The session starts with light drifting or targeted jigging to catch fresh squid (totani).
The Hunt: Once the cephalopods are rigged, we deploy our lines into the darkness. We use light-signaling systems (strobe lights and glow sticks) to create a visual trail that guides the Swordfish toward the strike.
Fighting a Swordfish under the stars, surrounded by total darkness, is an unforgettable experience. Every vibration of the rod in the nocturnal silence is a unique thrill. On board, the crew will manage every phase—from instrumental navigation to positioning the baits at specific depths—to give you the chance to face the true "Gladiator of the Sea."`;
let galleryMedia = [];

try {
	const galleryDir = new URL('../../public/gallery/', import.meta.url);
	const entries = await readdir(galleryDir, { withFileTypes: true });

	galleryMedia = entries
		.filter((entry) => entry.isFile())
		.map((entry) => {
			const extension = path.extname(entry.name).toLowerCase();
			const isImage = imageExtensions.has(extension);
			const isVideo = videoExtensions.has(extension);

			if (!isImage && !isVideo) return null;

			return {
				name: entry.name,
				src: `/gallery/${entry.name}`,
				type: isVideo ? 'video' : 'image',
				alt: path
					.parse(entry.name)
					.name
					.replace(/[-_]+/g, ' ')
					.replace(/\b\w/g, (char) => char.toUpperCase())
			};
		})
		.filter(Boolean)
		.sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name));
} catch (error) {
	console.error('Unable to load media from public/gallery:', error);
}

const trips = [
	{
		id: 1,
		title: 'Big Game Drifting Tuna',
		startTime: '08:00am',
		image: 'public/tuna.jpg',
		description: driftingTuna,
		features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
		pricing: '8h — €750/gruppo|4h — €450/gruppo'
	},
	{
		id: 2,
		title: 'Trolling Offshore',
		startTime: '08:00am',
		image: 'trolling.png',
		description: trollingOffshore,
		features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
		pricing: '8h — €900/gruppo'
	},
	{
		id: 3,
		title: 'Trolling Inshore',
		startTime: '08:00am',
		image: 'inshore.jpg',
		description: trollingInshore,
		features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
		pricing: '8h — €750/gruppo'
	},
	{
		id: 4,
		title: 'Bottom Fishing',
		startTime: '08:00am',
		image: 'bottom.webp',
		description: bolentino,
		features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
		pricing: '8h — €650/gruppo|4h — €450/gruppo'
	},
	{
		id: 5,
		title: 'Swordfish Night Fishing',
		startTime: '08:00pm',
		image: 'public/swordfish.jpg',
		description: swordfishNight,
		features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
		pricing: '€1.500/gruppo'
	},
	{
		id: 6,
		title: 'Octopus and Squid Fishing',
		startTime: '08:00am',
		image: 'public/octopus.jpg',
		description: octoupus,
		features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
		pricing: '8h — €600/gruppo'
	}
];

const cardSchemes = [
	{
		bar: 'background:linear-gradient(to right,#22d3ee,#0ea5e9,#3b82f6)',
		cardBg: 'background:#ffffff',
		titleGrad: "font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;color:#0f172a",
	},
];

const tripsWithSchemes = trips.map((trip, i) => ({ ...trip, s: cardSchemes[i % cardSchemes.length] }));
---

<Layout title="Big Catch Fishing Charters - Rome">
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="relative flex min-h-[600px] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 sm:min-h-[700px]">
		<!-- Background Video -->
		<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
			<video 
				src="/video-hero.mp4" 
				autoplay
				muted
				loop
				playsinline
				class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40"
			/>
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950/60 via-slate-950/40 to-slate-950/80"></div>
		</div>

		<!-- Content -->
		<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 id="hero-title" class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-50 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
				Rome Fishing Charters
			</h1>

			<p id="hero-subtitle" class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300 sm:text-base">
				More than 10 years fishing the coast's of Rome
			</p>
			
			<p id="hero-intro" class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
				Embark on an unforgettable fishing adventure in Rome. Our charter is designed to offer you more than just a simple boat trip; it is a true expedition into the heart of the Tyrrhenian Sea in search of the Mediterranean's most powerful predators: Bluefin Tuna, Mediterranean Spearfish and Swordfish, among others. Every excursion is engineered to maximize your chances of success and deliver a legendary fight. We utilize cutting-edge technology to ensure an unparalleled fishing experience.
			</p>

			<details class="group mt-4">
				<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-sky-400 transition-colors hover:text-sky-300">
					<span id="included-title">What's included</span>
					<svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
					</svg>
				</summary>
				<div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-center">
					<div class="inline-block rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-950/50 p-6 text-left backdrop-blur-sm">
						<p id="included-subtitle" class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-200">All our excursions include:</p>
						<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-sky-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
								</svg>
								<span id="included-item-1">Premium Gear: High-end equipment selected from the finest Japanese, American, Australian, and Italian brands.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-sky-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
								</svg>
								<span id="included-item-2">Food & Drinks, Fuel, Bait.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-sky-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
								</svg>
								<span id="included-item-3">On Board, you will find everything you need for a professional fishing session.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</details>

			<a 
				id="hero-book-link"
				href="https://wa.me/393793554548?text=Hi!%20I'm%20interested%20in%20booking%20a%20fishing%20trip%20with%20your%20charter.%20Could%20you%20please%20send%20me%20more%20info%20about%20your%20packages%20and%20availability%3F%20Thanks!"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="mt-8 mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-green-600 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-green-600/30 transition-all hover:bg-green-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-green-500/40 sm:px-10 sm:py-4 sm:text-lg"
			>
				<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z"/>
					<path d="M12 0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12c0 2.123.554 4.118 1.528 5.855L.057 23.882a.5.5 0 00.61.61l6.037-1.47A11.955 11.955 0 0012 24c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12S18.627 0 12 0zm0 21.818a9.808 9.808 0 01-5.027-1.384l-.36-.214-3.733.909.934-3.63-.235-.374A9.818 9.818 0 012.182 12C2.182 6.57 6.57 2.182 12 2.182S21.818 6.57 21.818 12 17.43 21.818 12 21.818z"/>
				</svg>
				<span id="hero-book-text">Book Now</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Book Your Trip Section -->
	<section id="trips" class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-sky-50/60 py-16 sm:py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mb-12 text-center">
				<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-sky-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white shadow-md shadow-cyan-400/30">
					<svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
					<span id="trips-title">BOOK YOUR TRIP</span>
				</span>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl" style="font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif">
					Choose Your <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0891b2,#0369a1);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text">Adventure</span>
				</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				{tripsWithSchemes.map((trip) => (
					<article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/10" style={trip.s.cardBg}>
						<button
							type="button"
							class="trip-card-trigger block w-full cursor-pointer text-left"
							data-trip-id={trip.id}
							data-title={trip.title}
							data-start-time={trip.startTime}
							data-image={trip.image}
							data-description={trip.description}
							data-features={trip.features.join('|')}
							data-pricing={trip.pricing}
							aria-label={`Open details for ${trip.title}`}
						>
							<!-- Image Container -->
							<div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-slate-100">
								{trip.image ? (
									<img
										src={trip.image}
										alt={trip.title}
										class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
									/>
								) : (
									<div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center text-slate-600">
										<svg class="h-16 w-16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
											<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
										</svg>
									</div>
								)}
							</div>

							<div class="h-2 w-full" style={trip.s.bar}></div>
							<!-- Content -->
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="trip-card-title text-xl font-black" style={trip.s.titleGrad}>
									{trip.title}
								</h3>

								<div class="trip-card-pricing mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1">
									{trip.pricing.split('|').map((p) => (
										<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 ring-1 ring-amber-200">
											<svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
												<path d="M8.433 7.418c.155-.103.346-.196.567-.267v1.698a2.305 2.305 0 01-.567-.267C8.07 8.34 8 8.114 8 8c0-.114.07-.34.433-.582zM11 12.849v-1.698c.22.071.412.164.567.267.364.243.433.468.433.582 0 .114-.07.34-.433.582a2.305 2.305 0 01-.567.267z"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-13a1 1 0 10-2 0v.092a4.535 4.535 0 00-1.676.662C6.602 6.234 6 7.009 6 8c0 .99.602 1.765 1.324 2.246.48.32 1.054.545 1.676.662v1.941c-.391-.127-.68-.317-.843-.504a1 1 0 10-1.51 1.31c.562.649 1.413 1.076 2.353 1.253V15a1 1 0 102 0v-.092a4.535 4.535 0 001.676-.662C13.398 13.766 14 12.991 14 12c0-.99-.602-1.765-1.324-2.246A4.535 4.535 0 0011 9.092V7.151c.391.127.68.317.843.504a1 1 0 101.511-1.31c-.563-.649-1.413-1.076-2.354-1.253V5z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
											</svg>
											{p}
										</span>
									))}
								</div>
								
								<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">
									<span class="trip-start-label">Start</span> <span class="trip-start-time">{trip.startTime}</span>
								</p>

								<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
									{trip.features.map((feature) => (
										<li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
											<svg class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-cyan-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
												<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
											</svg>
											<span class="trip-feature-text">{feature}</span>
										</li>
									))}
								</ul>
							</div>
						</button>
					</article>
				))}
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div id="trip-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[70] hidden items-center justify-center bg-slate-950/90 p-3 sm:p-4">
		<button
			type="button"
			id="trip-modal-close"
			class="absolute right-3 top-3 z-10 rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white/90 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-100 sm:right-4 sm:top-4"
			aria-label="Close trip details"
		>
			Close
		</button>

		<div class="flex max-h-[90dvh] w-full max-w-3xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-2xl">
			<img id="trip-modal-image" src="" alt="" class="hidden w-full flex-shrink-0 object-cover sm:block sm:aspect-[16/9]" />
			<div class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto">
				<div class="space-y-3 p-4 sm:space-y-4 sm:p-6">
					<h3 id="trip-modal-title" class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl"></h3>
					<p id="trip-modal-start" class="text-sm text-slate-500"></p>
					<div id="trip-modal-pricing" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 ring-1 ring-amber-200"></div>
					<div id="trip-modal-features" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
					<p id="trip-modal-description" class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700"></p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex-shrink-0 border-t border-slate-100 p-4 sm:p-6">
				<a
					id="trip-modal-book"
					href="https://wa.me/393793554548"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-green-500"
				>
					Book Now
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Vessel & Arsenal Section -->
	<section id="vessel" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-cyan-50 to-blue-50 py-16 sm:py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

			<div class="mb-12 text-center">
				<span id="vessel-badge" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-sky-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white shadow-md shadow-cyan-400/30">
					Equipment
				</span>
				<h2 id="vessel-title" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl" style="font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0891b2,#0369a1);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text">Built for Battle</h2>
